# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Overview {#overview}"
msgstr "Gambaran Keseluruhan {#overview}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Parity Twine Optimizer allows users to solve optimization problems with quantum computers using the [Parity Twine method](https://arxiv.org/abs/2501.14020).\n"
"This approach, built on the Parity Architecture, uses the ParityQC compiler to minimize the gate counts and circuit depth required to run a quantum algorithm while accounting for device connectivity.\n"
msgstr ""
"Parity Twine Optimizer membolehkan pengguna menyelesaikan masalah pengoptimuman dengan komputer kuantum menggunakan [kaedah Parity Twine](https://arxiv.org/abs/2501.14020).\n"
"Pendekatan ini, dibina berasaskan Parity Architecture, menggunakan pengkompil ParityQC untuk meminimumkan bilangan get dan kedalaman litar yang diperlukan untuk menjalankan algoritma kuantum sambil mengambil kira ketersambungan peranti.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This resource reduction enables solving industry-relevant optimization problems for sizes that are unfeasible with standard, SWAP-heavy, transpilation methods.\n"
"The Parity Twine Optimizer automates transpilation steps and can be used with minimal user input.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pengurangan sumber ini membolehkan penyelesaian masalah pengoptimuman yang relevan dengan industri untuk saiz yang tidak boleh dilaksanakan dengan kaedah transpilasi standard yang berat-SWAP.\n"
"Parity Twine Optimizer mengautomasikan langkah transpilasi dan boleh digunakan dengan input pengguna yang minimum.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Parity Twine approach outperforms all other compilation methods in terms of reducing gate counts and circuit depths for quantum algorithms such as the\n"
"[quantum approximate optimization algorithm (QAOA)](https://arxiv.org/abs/2501.14020) and [quantum Fourier transform (QFT)](https://arxiv.org/abs/2604.12465).\n"
"By abstracting quantum information away from the physical qubits, non-local interactions are implemented without SWAP gates. Instead, Parity Twine chains (sequences of CNOT gates) systematically distribute logical\n"
"parity information between qubits.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pendekatan Parity Twine mengatasi semua kaedah kompilasi lain dari segi pengurangan bilangan get dan kedalaman litar untuk algoritma kuantum seperti\n"
"[quantum approximate optimization algorithm (QAOA)](https://arxiv.org/abs/2501.14020) dan [quantum Fourier transform (QFT)](https://arxiv.org/abs/2604.12465).\n"
"Dengan mengabstrakkan maklumat kuantum daripada qubit fizikal, interaksi bukan setempat dilaksanakan tanpa get SWAP. Sebaliknya, rantai Parity Twine (jujukan get CNOT) mengagihkan maklumat pariti logik secara sistematik\n"
"antara qubit.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The optimizer uses the QAOA to minimize the energy of a given cost function. QAOA is a hybrid quantum-classical variational algorithm designed to solve combinatorial optimization problems by approximating the ground state\n"
"of a cost Hamiltonian ($H_C$). A mixing term ($H_B$) drives transitions between states to explore the solution space. An alternating sequence of these terms, controlled by parameters $\\gamma$ and $\\beta$, defines the unitary\n"
"$U(\\gamma, \\beta) = \\Pi_{i=1}^p e^{-i \\beta_i H_B} e^{-i \\gamma_i H_C}$, which acts on the initial state.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pengoptimum menggunakan QAOA untuk meminimumkan tenaga bagi fungsi kos yang diberikan. QAOA ialah algoritma variasi hibrid kuantum-klasik yang direka untuk menyelesaikan masalah pengoptimuman kombinatorik dengan menghampiri keadaan asas\n"
"bagi Hamiltonan kos ($H_C$). Terma percampuran ($H_B$) memacu peralihan antara keadaan untuk meneroka ruang penyelesaian. Jujukan berselang-seli bagi terma-terma ini, dikawal oleh parameter $\\gamma$ dan $\\beta$, mentakrifkan unitari\n"
"$U(\\gamma, \\beta) = \\Pi_{i=1}^p e^{-i \\beta_i H_B} e^{-i \\gamma_i H_C}$, yang bertindak ke atas keadaan awal.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Encoding of the problem unitary, exp($-i \\beta H_C)$), requires encoding of all logical $n$-body rotation operators (exp($-i \\beta J_{i,j,...n}Z_iZ_j...Z_n$)).\n"
"This can be accomplished using $n$-body generators (Parity Twine Networks), which reduce the QAOA circuit depth and two-qubit gate count.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pengekodan unitari masalah, exp($-i \\beta H_C)$), memerlukan pengekodan semua operator putaran $n$-body logik (exp($-i \\beta J_{i,j,...n}Z_iZ_j...Z_n$)).\n"
"Ini boleh dicapai dengan menggunakan penjana $n$-body (Rangkaian Parity Twine), yang mengurangkan kedalaman litar QAOA dan bilangan get dua-qubit.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Description {#description}"
msgstr "Penerangan {#description}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Parity Twine Optimizer input consists of an optimization problem, the chosen IBM Quantum hardware name, and additional optional arguments to tailor the transpilation and hardware execution settings. The optimizer\n"
"function routes the problem definition to the Parity Twine Compiler. Figure 1 shows a summary of the function workflow.\n"
msgstr ""
"Input Parity Twine Optimizer terdiri daripada masalah pengoptimuman, nama perkakasan IBM Quantum yang dipilih, dan argumen pilihan tambahan untuk menyesuaikan tetapan transpilasi dan pelaksanaan perkakasan. Fungsi pengoptimum\n"
"menghalakan takrifan masalah kepada Parity Twine Compiler. Rajah 1 menunjukkan ringkasan aliran kerja fungsi.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Parity Twine Optimizer workflow](/docs/images/guides/parity-twine-optimizer/process_pipeline.avif \"Figure 1: Summary of the Parity Twine Optimizer workflow.\")\n"
msgstr "![Parity Twine Optimizer workflow](/docs/images/guides/parity-twine-optimizer/process_pipeline.avif \"Figure 1: Summary of the Parity Twine Optimizer workflow.\")\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The input optimization problem is pre-processed into a (normalized) Hamiltonian. The ParityQC compiler then constructs a parameterized Parity Twine ansatz circuit, which is transpiled to a logical ansatz matching the native\n"
"gate set of the chosen hardware.\n"
msgstr ""
"Masalah pengoptimuman input diprapemproses menjadi Hamiltonan (ternormal). Pengkompil ParityQC kemudian membina litar ansatz Parity Twine berparameter, yang ditranspilkan kepada ansatz logik yang sepadan dengan set get\n"
"asli perkakasan yang dipilih.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"QAOA circuit parameters are classically optimized using the [\"efficient depth one\"](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qaoa_training_pipeline/blob/main/how_tos/efficient_depth_one.ipynb) approach and assigned to the transpiled circuit.\n"
"As one round of QAOA is used, optimal $\\gamma$ and $\\beta$ parameters are obtained using a grid search on a CPU without the need for costly iterative optimization\n"
"over many circuit calls. This greatly minimizes the required QPU runtime of the optimizer. Execution time per circuit is mostly determined by the constant overhead to run a job on the QPU.\n"
"With the circuit parameters set, the job is submitted to the specified IBM&reg; QPU.\n"
msgstr ""
"Parameter litar QAOA dioptimumkan secara klasik menggunakan pendekatan [\"efficient depth one\"](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qaoa_training_pipeline/blob/main/how_tos/efficient_depth_one.ipynb) dan ditetapkan kepada litar yang telah ditranspilkan.\n"
"Memandangkan satu pusingan QAOA digunakan, parameter $\\gamma$ dan $\\beta$ yang optimum diperoleh menggunakan carian grid pada CPU tanpa memerlukan pengoptimuman berulang yang mahal\n"
"merentasi banyak panggilan litar. Ini meminimumkan dengan ketara masa jalan QPU yang diperlukan oleh pengoptimum. Masa pelaksanaan bagi setiap litar sebahagian besarnya ditentukan oleh overhed tetap untuk menjalankan kerja pada QPU.\n"
"Dengan parameter litar ditetapkan, kerja dihantar ke QPU IBM&reg; yang ditentukan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Raw results are then post-processed. This step uses a local greedy search that iterates randomly through the solution string and flips bit values if this reduces the value of the cost function.\n"
msgstr "Hasil mentah kemudian dipasca-proses. Langkah ini menggunakan carian tamak (greedy) tempatan yang mengulangi secara rawak melalui rentetan penyelesaian dan menukar nilai bit jika ini mengurangkan nilai fungsi kos.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Benchmarks {#benchmarks}"
msgstr "Penanda Aras {#benchmarks}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"caution\" title=\"Disclaimer\">\n"
"Performance can depend on both the problem instance and subsequent processing steps. In some cases, classical samples and quantum-generated samples might achieve similar final solution quality after equivalent post-processing. Evaluation should therefore consider the complete optimization workflow.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"caution\" title=\"Penafian\">\n"
"Prestasi boleh bergantung kepada kedua-dua instans masalah dan langkah pemprosesan seterusnya. Dalam sesetengah kes, sampel klasik dan sampel yang dijana secara kuantum mungkin mencapai kualiti penyelesaian akhir yang serupa selepas pasca-pemprosesan yang setara. Oleh itu, penilaian harus mempertimbangkan keseluruhan aliran kerja pengoptimuman.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Sherrington-Kirkpatrick model {#sherrington-kirkpatrick-model}"
msgstr "Model Sherrington-Kirkpatrick {#sherrington-kirkpatrick-model}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Figure 2 demonstrates the effectiveness of the Parity Twine Optimizer. This compares results obtained using the optimizer against random sampling for the Sherrington-Kirkpatrick model\n"
"with increasing qubits.\n"
msgstr ""
"Rajah 2 menunjukkan keberkesanan Parity Twine Optimizer. Ini membandingkan hasil yang diperoleh menggunakan pengoptimum dengan pensampelan rawak untuk model Sherrington-Kirkpatrick\n"
"dengan bilangan qubit yang semakin meningkat.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Post-processing of both the random and optimizer results leads to exact ground states, but the raw minimum energy output from Twine QAOA is always better than random\n"
"values. For the largest qubit numbers considered (90 and 100), hardware noise degrades the optimizer result where it reverts to raw values matching random sampling.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pasca-pemprosesan bagi kedua-dua hasil rawak dan hasil pengoptimum membawa kepada keadaan asas yang tepat, tetapi output tenaga minimum mentah daripada Twine QAOA sentiasa lebih baik daripada nilai\n"
"rawak. Untuk bilangan qubit terbesar yang dipertimbangkan (90 dan 100), hingar perkakasan menjejaskan hasil pengoptimum sehingga ia kembali kepada nilai mentah yang sepadan dengan pensampelan rawak.\n"

