# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Market Split problem {#market-split-problem}"
msgstr "Masalah Market Split {#market-split-problem}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Table 1 shows specific performance metrics for the Parity Twine Optimizer applied to various instances of the Market Split (MS) problem.\n"
"These were obtained from the [QOBLIB - Quantum Optimization Benchmarking Library](https://github.com/ZIB-AOPT/QOBLIB) and correspond to\n"
"[submissions](https://github.com/ZIB-AOPT/QOBLIB/tree/main/01-marketsplit/submissions/20260728_Parity_Twine_Optimizer) made to the\n"
"library using the Parity Twine Optimizer.\n"
msgstr ""
"Jadual 1 menunjukkan metrik prestasi khusus untuk Parity Twine Optimizer yang digunakan pada pelbagai instans masalah Market Split (MS).\n"
"Ini diperoleh daripada [QOBLIB - Quantum Optimization Benchmarking Library](https://github.com/ZIB-AOPT/QOBLIB) dan sepadan dengan\n"
"[penyerahan](https://github.com/ZIB-AOPT/QOBLIB/tree/main/01-marketsplit/submissions/20260728_Parity_Twine_Optimizer) yang dibuat ke\n"
"perpustakaan menggunakan Parity Twine Optimizer.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"MS violation is an accuracy metric that measures how far the solution is from satisfying all constraints, defined as $\\sum_i ((Ax - b)_i)^2$. Lower values of this metric indicate more accurate solutions.\n"
"Table 1 reports averaged values for five runs of each instance using the Parity Twine Optimizer with the `ibm_boston` device as a backend and 100,000 shots.\n"
"The minimum MS violation obtained from the runs of each instance is reported.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pelanggaran MS ialah metrik ketepatan yang mengukur sejauh mana penyelesaian daripada memenuhi semua kekangan, ditakrifkan sebagai $\\sum_i ((Ax - b)_i)^2$. Nilai metrik ini yang lebih rendah menunjukkan penyelesaian yang lebih tepat.\n"
"Jadual 1 melaporkan nilai purata untuk lima larian bagi setiap instans menggunakan Parity Twine Optimizer dengan peranti `ibm_boston` sebagai backend dan 100,000 tangkapan.\n"
"Pelanggaran MS minimum yang diperoleh daripada larian setiap instans dilaporkan.\n"

