# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Maximum Independent Set problem {#maximum-independent-set-problem}"
msgstr "Masalah Maximum Independent Set {#maximum-independent-set-problem}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Figure 3 compares results obtained using the Parity Twine optimizer against random sampling for the maximum independent set problem for selected instances\n"
"obtained from the [QOBLIB - Quantum Optimization Benchmarking Library](https://github.com/ZIB-AOPT/QOBLIB). These range from 18 (mammalia-kangaroo-interactions) to\n"
"114 (es60fst03) qubits.\n"
msgstr ""
"Rajah 3 membandingkan hasil yang diperoleh menggunakan pengoptimum Parity Twine dengan pensampelan rawak untuk masalah maximum independent set bagi instans terpilih\n"
"yang diperoleh daripada [QOBLIB - Quantum Optimization Benchmarking Library](https://github.com/ZIB-AOPT/QOBLIB). Ini terdiri daripada 18 (mammalia-kangaroo-interactions) hingga\n"
"114 (es60fst03) qubit.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For small instances, the raw Maximum Independent Set size results from the optimizer and random sampling are similar, but for larger instances, the optimizer gives far better results.\n"
"Post-processing of both the random-sampled and optimizer results again leads to set sizes in agreement with exact values.\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk instans kecil, hasil saiz Maximum Independent Set mentah daripada pengoptimum dan pensampelan rawak adalah serupa, tetapi untuk instans yang lebih besar, pengoptimum memberikan hasil yang jauh lebih baik.\n"
"Pasca-pemprosesan bagi kedua-dua hasil pensampelan rawak dan hasil pengoptimum sekali lagi membawa kepada saiz set yang selaras dengan nilai tepat.\n"

