# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Parity Twine Optimizer can be applied to a simple QUBO example as follows. The problem is first defined by using a dictionary:\n"
msgstr "Parity Twine Optimizer boleh digunakan pada contoh QUBO mudah seperti berikut. Masalah ini mula-mula ditakrifkan dengan menggunakan kamus:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Then, the variable type has be defined as `binary` or `spin`:\n"
msgstr "Kemudian, jenis pemboleh ubah perlu ditakrifkan sebagai `binary` atau `spin`:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This defines the objective function $3 + s_0 + 2 s_0s_1 - s_1s_2$ where $s_i \\in \\{-1, 1\\}$.\n"
msgstr "Ini mentakrifkan fungsi objektif $3 + s_0 + 2 s_0s_1 - s_1s_2$ dengan $s_i \\in \\{-1, 1\\}$.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
